---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - NovaTools"
  description="Terms of service and usage conditions for NovaTools client-side utility suite."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-[#2A2D33] pb-5">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#ECEDEF]">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-[#8B8F98] font-mono">Last Updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#8B8F98] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-4 sm:p-5">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using NovaTools (<a href="https://novatools.app" class="text-[#4F8CFF] hover:underline">novatools.app</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, discontinue use immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2 rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-4 sm:p-5">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">2. License & Client Runtime Execution</h2>
        <p>
          NovaTools grants you a free, non-exclusive license to use the browser-based utilities for personal and commercial media/document processing.
        </p>
        <p>
          Because all computation occurs directly on your client hardware, you are solely responsible for ensuring your machine has sufficient memory and CPU capacity to transcode target media.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2 rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-4 sm:p-5">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          NovaTools is provided on an "AS IS" basis without warranties of any kind. While our WebAssembly and PDF algorithms are rigorously tested, we advise retaining original backups of all source files.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
